<title>SWITZERLAND: Sulzer shares jump on Swiss bourse.</title>
<headline>Sulzer shares jump on Swiss bourse.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares and participation certificates in Sulzer AG rose and the gap between the two securities narrowed as the market speculated the group may simplify its capital structure.</p>
<p>Registered shares stood 32 Swiss francs higher at 967 francs at 1215 GMT, up 3.4 percent as against a 0.2 percent drop on the blue-chip Swiss Market Index (SMI).</p>
<p>Participation certificates were up 50 francs or 5.6 percent at 944 francs.</p>
</text>
